<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Bank to brief media on earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Bank to brief media on earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanwa Bank Ltd said on Friday that it would hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) on a revision in its earnings forecast.  </p>
<p>The bank said in November that it expected current revenues of 2.7 trillion yen and parent current profits of 110 billion yen in the year ending on March 31.</p>
</text>
